{"seq":3,"slug":"writing-templates","title":"高三英语 — 写作模板","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/language-review/writing-templates","wordCount":1882,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"高三英语-写作模板\">高三英语 — 写作模板</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>高考英语写作（应用文写作）分值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span></span> 分，考查考生在特定情境下用英语进行书面交际的能力。常见题型包括书信（建议信、邀请信、感谢信、道歉信、申请信）、通知、倡议书和发言稿等。与读后续写的&quot;创意驱动&quot;不同，应用文写作更强调&quot;格式规范、要点齐全、语言得体&quot;。高三复习阶段需要建立一套可靠的写作模板体系——不是死记硬背的&quot;万能模板&quot;，而是针对不同文体和话题的&quot;框架 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 高级表达&quot;组合。</p>\n<p>应用文写作的评分标准：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>高分标准</th>\n<th>低分表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内容完整</td>\n<td>涵盖所有要求的信息点</td>\n<td>遗漏要点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式正确</td>\n<td>符合文体格式要求</td>\n<td>格式缺失或错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言质量</td>\n<td>词汇丰富，句式多样，无语法错误</td>\n<td>词汇单一，句式简单，语法错误多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑连贯</td>\n<td>行文流畅，衔接自然</td>\n<td>内容跳跃，缺少过渡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语域得体</td>\n<td>语言风格匹配场合和对象</td>\n<td>过于口语化或过于正式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-书信类写作通用框架\">一、书信类写作通用框架</h3><p>书信是高考应用文的第一大类。所有书信共享以下基本结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Dear [收件人],&#10;&#10;[开头段：自我介绍 + 写信目的]（2-3 句）&#10;&#10;[主体段：详细内容/建议/理由]（5-8 句）&#10;&#10;[结尾段：期望回复/表达感谢/再次表态]（1-2 句）&#10;&#10;Yours sincerely / Best regards,&#10;[你的名字]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Dear [收件人],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[开头段：自我介绍 + 写信目的]（2-3 句）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[主体段：详细内容/建议/理由]（5-8 句）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[结尾段：期望回复/表达感谢/再次表态]（1-2 句）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Yours sincerely / Best regards,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[你的名字]</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"二-各类书信的模板与高级表达\">二、各类书信的模板与高级表达</h3><p><strong>建议信</strong>（Suggestion Letter）：</p>\n<p>开头：I&#39;m writing to offer some suggestions regarding...</p>\n<p>主体高级表达：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提出建议</td>\n<td>I would strongly recommend that you... / It might be a good idea to... / You might want to consider...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>给出理由</td>\n<td>The reason I suggest this is that... / This approach has the advantage of...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补充建议</td>\n<td>Additionally / Furthermore / What&#39;s more, you could...</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结尾：I hope you will find these suggestions helpful. Please don&#39;t hesitate to contact me if you need further information.</p>\n<p><strong>邀请信</strong>（Invitation Letter）：</p>\n<p>开头：I&#39;m writing to invite you to [活动名称], which will be held on [日期] at [地点].</p>\n<p>主体高级表达：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>介绍活动</td>\n<td>The event is designed to... / It will feature... / There will be a variety of...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达期待</td>\n<td>It would be a great honor if you could attend. / Your presence would make the event even more special.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提供信息</td>\n<td>The event will start at... and last for approximately... / Please feel free to bring...</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结尾：I do hope you can make it. I&#39;m looking forward to your reply.</p>\n<p><strong>感谢信</strong>（Thank-you Letter）：</p>\n<p>开头：I&#39;m writing to express my sincere gratitude for your [帮助/礼物/建议].</p>\n<p>主体高级表达：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>描述帮助</td>\n<td>Without your help, I couldn&#39;t have... / It was your encouragement that enabled me to...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达感受</td>\n<td>I was deeply touched by your kindness. / Your generosity meant the world to me.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>积极影响</td>\n<td>Thanks to your guidance, I have made remarkable progress in...</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结尾：Words cannot fully express how grateful I am. I wish you all the best.</p>\n<p><strong>申请信</strong>（Application Letter）：</p>\n<p>开头：I&#39;m writing to apply for the position of [职位/机会].</p>\n<p>主体高级表达：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>展示资质</td>\n<td>I have a strong background in... / I am proficient in... / I have gained valuable experience through...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达热情</td>\n<td>I have always been passionate about... / This opportunity perfectly aligns with my interests.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>做出承诺</td>\n<td>I am confident that I can contribute to... / I would be dedicated to...</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结尾：I would appreciate it if you could give me an opportunity for an interview. Thank you for your time and consideration.</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-通知与倡议书模板\">三、通知与倡议书模板</h3><p><strong>通知</strong>（Notice）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"NOTICE&#10;[标题]&#10;&#10;[正文：活动时间、地点、内容、要求]&#10;&#10;All students are welcome / required to...&#10;For more information, please contact...&#10;&#10;                        Student Union&#10;                        [日期]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>NOTICE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[标题]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[正文：活动时间、地点、内容、要求]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>All students are welcome / required to...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>For more information, please contact...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        Student Union</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        [日期]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>倡议书</strong>（Proposal）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Dear fellow students,&#10;&#10;[开头：说明倡议背景和目的]&#10;&#10;In order to..., I&#39;d like to propose the following:&#10;&#10;First, we should... Second, it is important that we...&#10;Furthermore, each of us can make a difference by...&#10;&#10;[结尾：号召行动]&#10;&#10;Let&#39;s work together to make a positive change!&#10;&#10;                        Student Union\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Dear fellow students,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[开头：说明倡议背景和目的]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>In order to..., I'd like to propose the following:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>First, we should... Second, it is important that we...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Furthermore, each of us can make a difference by...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[结尾：号召行动]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Let's work together to make a positive change!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        Student Union</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"四-高分句型库\">四、高分句型库</h3><p><strong>开头句型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>高分表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>写信目的</td>\n<td>I&#39;m writing in response to your request for...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自我介绍</td>\n<td>As a senior student who has a keen interest in..., I...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达关注</td>\n<td>I was delighted to learn that... / It has come to my attention that...</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>过渡与衔接</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>补充</td>\n<td>In addition / Moreover / What&#39;s more / On top of that</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转折</td>\n<td>However / Nevertheless / On the other hand</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>举例</td>\n<td>For instance / To illustrate / Take... for example</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总结</td>\n<td>In conclusion / To sum up / All in all</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果</td>\n<td>As a result / Consequently / Therefore</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>结尾句型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>高分表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>期待回复</td>\n<td>I would appreciate it if you could reply at your earliest convenience.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达祝愿</td>\n<td>I wish you every success in your future endeavors.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>再次感谢</td>\n<td>Once again, I would like to extend my heartfelt thanks to you.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强调意愿</td>\n<td>I am eager to hear from you and hope for a favorable reply.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"五-提升语言质量的技巧\">五、提升语言质量的技巧</h3><p><strong>技巧一：句式多样化</strong></p>\n<p>避免全文使用简单句。在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 句的文章中，至少包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个复合句（定语从句、状语从句、名词性从句）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 个非谓语动词结构</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个强调句或倒装句（加分项）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>技巧二：词汇高级化</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基础表达</th>\n<th>高级替换</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I want to...</td>\n<td>I&#39;m eager to... / I would love to...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I hope...</td>\n<td>It is my sincere hope that...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>This is important.</td>\n<td>This is of great significance.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I can do it.</td>\n<td>I am confident in my ability to...</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>技巧三：使用高级句型</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>句型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>倒装句</td>\n<td>Not only will this improve..., but it will also...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强调句</td>\n<td>It is through hard work that we can achieve success.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟语气</td>\n<td>I would be grateful if you could consider my application.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>with 复合结构</td>\n<td>With the exam approaching, we should make full use of our time.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非谓语做状语</td>\n<td>Having learned about the activity, I am writing to...</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"六-写作实战流程\">六、写作实战流程</h3><p><strong>第一步：审题</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>确定文体（信/通知/发言稿？）</li>\n<li>圈出所有信息要点</li>\n<li>确定收信人/读者和你的身份</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>第二步：列提纲</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开头写什么？主体写几点？结尾怎么收束？</li>\n<li>每个要点用哪个高级句型？</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>第三步：写作</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按提纲逐段展开</li>\n<li>注意衔接过渡</li>\n<li>控制字数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 词）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>第四步：检查</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>要点是否齐全？</li>\n<li>格式是否正确？</li>\n<li>语法错误？拼写错误？</li>\n<li>字数是否达标？</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>为以下场景分别写出开头段和结尾段：①给外国友人写信介绍中秋节；②为校英语社团招新写一份通知；③向老师写感谢信。</li>\n<li>将以下基础版书信升级为高分版：原文 &quot;I want to join your club. I like English very much. I am good at speaking English.&quot; 用高级词汇和句式重写。</li>\n<li>整理一份&quot;个人高分句型卡&quot;，按开头/过渡/结尾分类，各收录 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 个你能熟练使用的高级表达。</li>\n<li>限时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟，完成一篇建议信（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 词左右），然后对照评分标准自评内容、格式、语言和连贯四个维度。</li>\n<li>互评练习：与同学交换应用文写作，重点评价对方的&quot;要点覆盖率&quot;和&quot;语言丰富度&quot;，给出具体改进建议。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>高考英语写作评分标准详见各省考试院发布的评分细则，理解&quot;五档评分&quot;的标准有助于针对性提分。</li>\n<li>英文商务邮件的写作规范与高考书信有共通之处——简洁、得体、目的明确。</li>\n<li>《Elements of Style》中&quot;用主动语态&quot;&quot;省略不必要的词语&quot;两条建议对高考英语写作同样适用。</li>\n<li>每天读一段英语优秀范文（如高考满分作文）并模仿其句型，是提升写作语感最直接的方法。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>应用文写作的备考核心是&quot;格式正确 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 要点齐全 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 语言丰富&quot;三位一体。建立分文体的写作框架（书信、通知、倡议书各有固定格式），储备各场景的高级表达（建议、感谢、邀请、申请），并在实战中练习句式多样化（复合句、非谓语、倒装句、强调句）。写作流程严格按&quot;审题→列纲→写作→检查&quot;四步执行，总用时控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟以内。不要迷信&quot;万能模板&quot;——阅卷老师能识别千篇一律的模板文。真正的高分来自于在模板框架基础上灵活运用高级表达，使文章既规范又有个性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高三英语 — 写作模板","id":"高三英语-写作模板"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、书信类写作通用框架","id":"一-书信类写作通用框架"},{"level":3,"text":"二、各类书信的模板与高级表达","id":"二-各类书信的模板与高级表达"},{"level":3,"text":"三、通知与倡议书模板","id":"三-通知与倡议书模板"},{"level":3,"text":"四、高分句型库","id":"四-高分句型库"},{"level":3,"text":"五、提升语言质量的技巧","id":"五-提升语言质量的技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"六、写作实战流程","id":"六-写作实战流程"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高三英语 — 词汇总复习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/language-review/vocabulary-review"},"next":{"title":"高三英语 — 听力训练","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/mock-practice/listening-practice"}}